# Windows-side artifacts that have no business in this repo. A literal
# %SystemDrive% directory appeared in v1.0.2/v1.0.3 (an unexpanded env var in
# a build step) and was committed; the files are removed from history since
# v1.0.4. Keep the path ignored so it can never come back.
/%SystemDrive%/
